            <description><![CDATA[<h2>RestinPID 3.10</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>The click guard now works every time you open the list.</b> A click right after the list opens is ignored (you'll hear a beep), so it can't restart an app you didn't mean to. In 3.9 this only worked the first time you opened it after RestinPID started.</li>
<li>The list no longer stays held from the last time it was open when you open it again.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
